From 5600f6b7bc5218bf1a1a0433430e3676a5aa714c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 09:00:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Sprites on units for the add-on, and a held last pose (patch
 0045)

SetUnitSprite: an add-on texture drawn additive as an oval facing the camera round a unit, a little
toward the camera (never more than half way to it), set each frame and gone when not set for half a
second (the ward's barrier). PlayUnitAnimation's tenth argument holds the clip's last pose that many
seconds (the ward's arm, one borrowed clip on every race); the same held clip asked for again holds
on from where it is rather than replaying from its first frame. A staff put away has its missiles
leave from the hands, not its tip on the back. HasActionCombat() says 25.
